msgstr "O jogo usa %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6306
msgid "In use"
msgstr "Em uso"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6326
msgid ""
"PC5 runs your PC games with prospero-win: Wine, DXVK for Direct3D 8 to 11, "
"VKD3D-Proton for Direct3D 12, and Mesa (RADV for Vulkan, Zink for OpenGL)."
msgstr ""
"O PC5 corre os teus jogos de PC com o prospero-win: Wine, DXVK para "
"Direct3D 8 a 11, VKD3D-Proton para Direct3D 12 e Mesa (RADV para Vulkan, "
"Zink para OpenGL)."

